Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Those copper dots
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.24,0:00:02.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,on jeans started
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.39,0:00:03.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,on horse blankets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.71,0:00:04.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,A tailor borrowed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:06.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,them\Nfor work trousers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.61,0:00:07.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,In Reno,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.23,0:00:08.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,tailor Jacob Davis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.63,0:00:09.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,used rivets on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:10.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,pocket corners
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.83,0:00:12.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,that tore apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.06,0:00:13.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,He couldn't afford
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.33,0:00:13.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,a patent,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.97,0:00:14.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,so he asked
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:15.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Levi Strauss to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.72,0:00:16.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,apply with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.76,0:00:17.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,In {\c&H45ADF2&}1873 {\c&HFFFFFF&}they
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.65,0:00:19.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,patented\Nan improvement
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:21.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,in fastening\Npocket openings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:23.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,But\Nback-pocket rivets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.35,0:00:24.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,scratched furniture
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:25.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,and saddles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.53,0:00:26.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,From {\c&H45ADF2&}1937 {\c&HFFFFFF&}they
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.94,0:00:28.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,were covered,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:29.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,and by {\c&H45ADF2&}1966{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.40,0:00:30.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,they were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.93,0:00:31.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,The rivets you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.81,0:00:32.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,see now still
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.63,0:00:33.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,guard the most
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:34.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,vulnerable spots.
